"Involutory permutation automorphisms of binary linear codes — MSGSÜ Açık Erişim (https://acikerisim.msgsu.edu.tr/xmlui/handle/20.500.14124/7842?show=full)\nciteturn4search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3.8 years ago; Crawled: 2 weeks ago; dc.identifier.uri  | https://doi.org/10.1142/S0219498825501373\n\nMakale·2023·Yalnızca künye\n\n# Involutory permutation automorphisms of binary linear codes\n\nAltunbulak Aksu, Fatma · Hafezieh, Roghayeh · Tuvay, Ipek\n\nDOIhttps://doi.org/10.1142/S0219498825501373\n\nYayıncıda Aç ↗Alıntıla Paylaş\n\nWe investigate the properties of binary linear codes of even length whose permutation automorphism group is a cyclic group generated by an involution. Up to dimension or co-dimension 4, we show that there is no quasi-group code whose permutation automorphism group is isomorphic to C-2. By generalizing the method we use to prove this result, we obtain results on the structure of putative extremal self-dual [16, 36, 72] and [20, 48, 96] codes in the presence of an involutory permutation automorphism.\n\nErişim ve lisans\n\nYalnızca künye · info:eu-repo/semantics/openAccess\nArşive eklendi: 09.01.2025\n\n\nDergi\n    Journal of Algebra and Its Applications\nDOI\n    10.1142/S0219498825501373\nISSN\n    0219-4988\nDizin\n    Web of Science · Scopus\nÇeyreklik\n    Q2\nYayın kategorisi\n    Makale - Uluslararası Hakemli Dergi - Kurum Öğretim Elemanı\nBölüm\n    Mimar Sinan Güzel Sanatlar Üniversitesi\nYıl\n    2023\nDil\n    İngilizce\nKonu başlıkları\n    Group code · quasi-group code · permutation automorphism of a code\nKalıcı bağlantı\n    hdl.handle.net/20.500.14124/7842\nErişim\n    Yalnızca künye\nHaklar\n    info:eu-repo/semantics/openAccess\nArşive eklendi\n    09.01.2025\nHam metadata (34 alan)\ndc.contributor.author  | Altunbulak Aksu, Fatma\ndc.contributor.author  | Hafezieh, Roghayeh\ndc.contributor.author  | Tuvay, Ipek\ndc.date.accessioned  | 2025-01-09T20:07:55Z\ndc.date.available  | 2025-01-09T20:07:55Z\ndc.date.issued  |